WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.418 --> 00:00:02.627
<i>Are we ready?</i>

00:00:06.464 --> 00:00:08.633
As a stand-up comedian,
and a female,

00:00:08.717 --> 00:00:11.636
it is very difficult
to get a little shine.

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:12.762
<i>These are my comics.</i>

00:00:12.846 --> 00:00:14.556
You’re gonna love ‘em, because...

00:00:14.639 --> 00:00:17.058
They ready!

00:00:17.559 --> 00:00:19.894
I started doing stand-up comedy
while I was homeless.

00:00:19.978 --> 00:00:22.439
I was my grandmother’s translator
my whole life.

00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:25.817
I did not know how
to say syphilis in Spanish.

00:00:26.401 --> 00:00:28.653
<i>I started stand-up in 2003.</i>

00:00:28.737 --> 00:00:30.822
I was doing open mics.
I fell in love.

00:00:30.905 --> 00:00:31.906
It was a outlet for me.

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:34.033
These dudes are being
disrespectful to my girl,

00:00:34.117 --> 00:00:34.951
and she looking at me like,

00:00:35.034 --> 00:00:36.870
“You just gonna let them talk
to me like that?”

00:00:36.953 --> 00:00:40.498
I’m like, “Now hold on, baby.
I just play a man, all right?”

00:00:41.082 --> 00:00:42.417
<i>I grew up in a foster home.</i>

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:43.585
Instead of crying about it,

00:00:43.668 --> 00:00:45.587
I said, let me just put
this all on stage.

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:47.088
When it’s time
to get on the plane,

00:00:47.172 --> 00:00:49.632
we need you to get to your
seat and sit the fuck down.

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:53.428
White people always wait to get
to they seat to fold they coat,

00:00:53.511 --> 00:00:55.472
take out they laptop.

00:00:55.555 --> 00:00:58.349
Look here, Bob.
Sit the fuck down!

00:00:59.517 --> 00:01:02.395
I’ve been doing comedy
for 17 years.

00:01:02.479 --> 00:01:04.147
There’s no reason
to be a lady comic

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:05.648
if you had a normal upbringing.

00:01:05.732 --> 00:01:09.527
We were so poor, my dad bought
all of his medicine at pet stores

00:01:09.611 --> 00:01:12.322
and insisted
it was the same thing.

00:01:12.822 --> 00:01:14.073
<i>Tiffany saw me.</i>

00:01:14.157 --> 00:01:16.951
She heard through my stories and
through my jokes on stage;

00:01:17.035 --> 00:01:19.704
she knew that there was
somebody up under all of that.

00:01:19.788 --> 00:01:20.705
I’m in the bathroom
changing tonight.

00:01:20.789 --> 00:01:22.248
Two sisters in the bathroom,

00:01:22.332 --> 00:01:23.833
“Girl, did you see the man
in the blue dress?”

00:01:23.917 --> 00:01:26.169
And I said,
“Yeah, bitch, I’m in here.”

00:01:27.295 --> 00:01:28.963
I can’t thank you enough, really.

00:01:29.047 --> 00:01:30.048
-You don’t gotta thank me.
-All I gotta do...

00:01:30.131 --> 00:01:30.965
is just go out there
and just kill it.

00:01:31.049 --> 00:01:31.925
Yeah, that’ll be my thank you.

00:01:32.008 --> 00:01:33.259
I joined Weight Watchers.

00:01:33.343 --> 00:01:34.636
I did it 'cause Oprah told me to.

00:01:34.719 --> 00:01:37.430
I woke up one morning,
Oprah Winfrey was on my screen,

00:01:37.514 --> 00:01:40.475
and she said, “I love bread.

00:01:40.975 --> 00:01:42.435
I love bread!”

00:01:43.561 --> 00:01:45.772
<i>The world deserves
to get to see y’all shine.</i>

00:01:45.855 --> 00:01:46.689
It’s time to shine.

00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:47.524
Yeah!

00:01:48.399 --> 00:01:49.234
Accept who you are.

00:01:50.401 --> 00:01:51.444
I love you guys.

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:57.242
You all deserve to be treated
with the most respect.

00:01:57.325 --> 00:02:00.036
Aw, bitch,
don’t you start that cryin’.

00:02:00.119 --> 00:02:01.496
Well, what the hell wrong
with y’all?

00:02:01.579 --> 00:02:03.873
Marlo, I seen you cry,
stop acting like you don’t cry.

